Danhong injection (DHI) is composed of
Danhong
and
Safflower
. DHI has the effect of promoting blood circulation and removing blood stasis, dredging pulse, and relaxing collaterals. The active ingredients of DHI are ferulic acid, cryptotanshinone, quercetin, and anhydrosafflor yellow B [
133
].
Studies have shown that DHI can reduce cerebral edema and preserve ischemic penumbra after cerebral ischemia–reperfusion [
134
