172
]. Combined with the above evidence, it is suggested that SXT may alleviate IS-induced apoptosis and oxidative stress through the PI3K/Akt signaling pathway.
In clinical treatment, previous studies have shown that SXT is effective in the treatment of cerebral infarction with few adverse reactions. However, caution should be taken against the use with pregnant women and patients with hemorrhagic diseases [
173
].
